### 웹훅 생성
POST {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/webhooks
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "cowork"
}

### 웹훅 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/webhooks
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 웹훅 수정
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/webhooks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "cowork",
  "rotateToken": false
}

### 웹훅 삭제
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/webhooks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
